t my friends to like  think bad about me  to avoid being separated jj and his  family temporarily moved in with a  friend  in october they received housing but it  was like another way of like  now we can finally breathe and like put  ourselves back  together despite this new stability the  family was still without mattresses warm  clothes and furniture  after a little convincing poll created a  gofundme account for the family and  within 24 hours i had over a thousand  dollars it was pretty amazing  now with help from the community the  family is focused on moving forward  together  i don't want my kids to give up ever  you know and if they're not going to  give up i'm not going to give up  paul is now trying to maximize these  donations so she can continue to help  families in our area the donations that  she's received so far are from fellow  teachers  as well as former students that she's  helped in the past who are now paying it  forward
 

